  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> be two vectors. Consider a vector <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If the projection of <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> on the vector <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math> then the minimum value of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> equals",
    "image": null
  },
